OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered early showers become
OL,6,Ffrequent and heavy for a time around
OL,7,Fmidday. Showers will turn wintry from
OL,8,Fearly afternoon. Fresh to strong
OL,9,Fnorthwest winds increase to gale over
OL,10,Fnorthern coasts later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers will continue
OL,13,Fovernight, these showers will become
OL,14,Ffrequent and heavy at times with some
OL,15,Fwintry. Gale northwest winds spread to
OL,16,Fwestern coasts overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
